{"id":"task-008","title":"Fix: type errors and missing output files from tasks 4 & 5","description":"Mechanical fixes to unblock review. The implementation work for task-004 and task-005 is complete and on disk. Two issues remain:\n\n## 1. Fix typecheck errors in `lib/context-messages.test.ts`\nRun `npx tsc --noEmit` and fix the 2 errors (lines ~268 and ~336) where test fixtures are missing the `routingInstructions` field in `ContextBlocks`. Add the missing field with appropriate values.\n\n## 2. Write missing output files\nRead the actual work done on disk and write summary files:\n\n**`/home/vedat/work/personal/semblr/temp/task-004-output.md`** — summarize task-004 work:\n- Read `src/semblr.ts` and document: tool registration location, handler logic, model switching at agent_end, stream announcements\n- Read `lib/context-format.ts` and `lib/context-messages.ts` for context injection changes\n\n**`/home/vedat/work/personal/semblr/temp/task-005-output.md`** — summarize task-005 work:\n- Read `tests/routing-behavior.test.ts` and document: test categories, test count, coverage\n\n## 3. Verify\n```bash\nnpx tsc --noEmit   # must pass with 0 errors\nnpx vitest run     # all 507+ tests pass\n```\n\n## 4. Commit all work\n```bash\ngit add -A\ngit commit -m \"feat: multi-model routing foundation (issue #86)\n\n- Add PhaseName, PhaseModelMap, MultiModelRoutingConfig types\n- Add multiModelRouting config toggle (opt-in, default off)\n- Add resolve-model-id helper (strips :cloud suffix)\n- Add MVP phase→model map (Ollama-Cloud models)\n- Register semblr_report_phase tool with TypeBox schema\n- Implement model switching at agent_end boundaries\n- Add stream announcements on model switches\n- Add context injection for routing tool\n- Add 54 routing behavior tests\n\n🤖 LLM authored\"\n```\n\nWrite summary to `/home/vedat/work/personal/semblr/temp/task-008-output.md`.","status":"executing","agent_id":"coder","dependencies":[],"files_touched":["temp/task-004-output.md","temp/task-